    {
      "flavor_text": "ひあたりの　よい　みずべに　すむ。\nひるまは　みずくさの　ベッドで\nねむり　ひが　くれると　うごきだす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "햇볕이 잘 드는 물가에 산다.\n낮에는 수초로 된 침대에서\n자고 해가 지면 활동하기 시작한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il vit au bord de l’eau dans les endroits ensoleillés.\nLe jour, il s’endort sur un tas d’algues et ne se lève\nqu’à la nuit tombée.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es lebt am Ufer, wo die Sonne scheint.\nTagsüber schläft es in einem Bett aus Schilf\nund wird nachts aktiv.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en el agua y, cuando hace sol, se queda en la\norilla. De día duerme sobre las algas y de noche entra\nen acción.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive in riva a specchi d’acqua, in aree soleggiate.\nDi giorno dorme su di un letto di alghe, mentre la\nnotte è attivo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It lives at the water’s edge where it is sunny.\nIt sleeps on a bed of water-grass by day and\nbecomes active at night.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "日当たりの　良い　水辺に　住む。\n昼間は　水草の　ベッドで　眠り\n日が　暮れると　動き出す。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en el agua y, cuando hace sol, se queda en la\norilla. De día duerme sobre las algas y de noche entra\nen acción.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "つりびとを　みつけると\nすいちゅうから　つりいとを　ひっぱり\nジャマして　よろこぶ　いたずらもの。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "낚시꾼을 발견하면\n물속에서 낚싯줄을 잡아당겨\n방해하며 좋아하는 장난꾸러기다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "C’est un mauvais plaisantin. Quand il repère un\npêcheur, il tire sur sa ligne pour le déranger.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es hat ein spitzbübisches Wesen. Sieht es einen\nAngler, zieht es an der Angelschnur, um ihn zu ärgern.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tiene carácter travieso. Si ve un pescador, tira del\nanzuelo para confundirlo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È un po’ dispettoso. Se vede un pescatore, gli tira\nla lenza solo per dargli fastidio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler,\nit will tug on the fishing line to interfere.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "釣り人を　見つけると\n水中から　釣り糸を　引っ張り\nジャマして　喜ぶ　いたずらもの。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tiene carácter travieso. Si ve un pescador, tira del\nanzuelo para confundirlo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
